From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryder Belserion <contact@ryderbelserion.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 11:38:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Update command framework to 2026!

This framework now requires a minimal of Java 25, and the newest versions of Kord, JDA, and Paper.

Minecraft support for anything that isn't 26.3 is now dropped, and all reflection calls to ensure multi version support is removed.

Legacy command support i.e. extending `Command` is obsolete and is planned to be removed in the future... All command handling is now done by extending BasicCommand which is part of the newer api provided by Paper.

The rest of the changes are simply code style changes to keep me sane.

